WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.640
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:37.910 --> 01:44.020
[Small Town Remedy]

3
01:44.160 --> 01:46.800
[Episode 28]

4
01:46.979 --> 01:47.759
[To spend the rest of my life in the name of love]

5
01:47.789 --> 01:49.660
[Joy Comes to Our Home] [Mr. Jia Xin and Ms. Gong Xue]

6
01:49.720 --> 01:51.920
[Happy]

7
01:51.920 --> 01:55.270
[Wedding Banquet]

8
01:55.270 --> 01:58.750
[Joy Comes to Our Home] [Jia Xin, Gong Xue]

9
01:58.860 --> 02:02.950
[Happy]

10
02:09.360 --> 02:10.800
How can I help you two?

11
02:10.800 --> 02:11.590
No need.

12
02:12.960 --> 02:14.560
Sir, your seat is over there.

13
02:14.710 --> 02:15.400
Okay.

14
02:16.520 --> 02:17.400
Director Duan.

15
02:17.400 --> 02:17.910
This way, please.

16
02:17.910 --> 02:19.000
Are you happy today?

17
02:19.000 --> 02:20.280
Very happy!

18
02:25.470 --> 02:26.870
Enjoy your meal.

19
02:31.030 --> 02:31.520
Take your seat.

20
02:31.520 --> 02:32.150
Auntie Duan.

21
02:32.150 --> 02:33.710
Congratulations! Congratulations!

22
02:33.710 --> 02:34.960
It's so festive today.

23
02:34.960 --> 02:36.470
Xue bought it for me!

24
02:36.560 --> 02:37.560
Does it look good?

25
02:37.630 --> 02:39.290
Such a good daughter-in-law.

26
02:41.870 --> 02:43.200
You two came quite fast.

27
02:53.079 --> 02:54.520
Memorizing your lines?

28
02:54.630 --> 02:56.560
You won't drop the ball later, will you?

29
02:56.560 --> 02:58.150
What do you mean by that?

30
02:58.750 --> 03:00.280
I've seen it all.

31
03:01.710 --> 03:03.310
I promise I won't embarrass you.

32
03:03.310 --> 03:04.710
You can't embarrass me,

33
03:04.710 --> 03:06.310
and you have to make me proud.

34
03:06.470 --> 03:07.470
Later, for the young couple,

35
03:07.470 --> 03:09.730
you have to get things off to a good start.

36
03:10.960 --> 03:11.870
Rest assured.

37
03:12.190 --> 03:13.800
I will definitely complete the task.

38
03:13.800 --> 03:14.560
You have to.

39
03:14.560 --> 03:15.820
We're counting on you.

40
03:20.750 --> 03:21.560
Going up?

41
03:24.750 --> 03:25.430
Great.

42
03:33.310 --> 03:34.150
Great!

43
03:43.400 --> 03:45.240
Distinguished guests,

44
03:45.520 --> 03:46.750
friends,

45
03:47.079 --> 03:48.400
welcome!

46
03:48.430 --> 03:49.430
-Great! -Great!

47
03:53.400 --> 03:54.870
Today

48
03:55.079 --> 03:58.590
is Jia Xin and Gong Xue's big day.

49
03:58.750 --> 04:00.360
We are here

50
04:00.520 --> 04:02.430
to witness the happy moment

51
04:02.430 --> 04:03.680
of the newlyweds!

52
04:03.960 --> 04:04.680
Great!

53
04:08.190 --> 04:08.910
The groom.

54
04:17.040 --> 04:17.829
Well.

55
04:18.160 --> 04:19.310
Now, please...

56
04:20.430 --> 04:22.920
Please welcome the bride to the stage.

57
04:28.240 --> 04:29.240
So beautiful!

58
04:29.830 --> 04:31.720
-Great! -Great!

59
04:37.360 --> 04:39.040
-Great! -Great!

60
04:46.430 --> 04:47.240
Dad.

61
04:49.680 --> 04:50.680
Leave Xue to me.

62
04:50.680 --> 04:51.880
You can rest assured.

63
04:52.120 --> 04:52.630
Good.

64
04:54.870 --> 04:56.390
Xue, hold the flowers.

65
04:57.750 --> 04:58.390
My child.

66
05:03.310 --> 05:03.950
Very good.

67
05:05.270 --> 05:05.720
-Great! -Great!

68
05:05.720 --> 05:06.520
So beautiful.

69
05:06.800 --> 05:08.240
What did they say? Speak louder!

70
05:08.240 --> 05:09.160
I didn't hear it!

71
05:09.160 --> 05:10.040
So beautiful!

72
05:18.950 --> 05:21.550
P-Please have the flower girl bring the rings.

73
05:26.750 --> 05:30.040
The ring is a token of love and commitment.

74
05:30.160 --> 05:32.240
It's the devotion of two hearts.

75
05:32.430 --> 05:34.159
It represents responsibility

76
05:34.190 --> 05:36.190
and cherishment.

77
05:37.920 --> 05:40.800
Please exchange the rings.

78
05:40.870 --> 05:42.240
Keep this commitment

79
05:42.240 --> 05:44.630
firmly on each other's fingertips,

80
05:44.750 --> 05:46.880
and carve it into each other's hearts.

81
05:47.270 --> 05:49.000
From now on, the left hand...

82
05:50.480 --> 05:51.920
The left hand holds you,

83
05:52.159 --> 05:53.750
and the right hand holds the rest of your life.

84
05:53.750 --> 05:55.000
In the name of love,

85
05:55.190 --> 05:56.750
stay together for a lifetime.

86
05:56.750 --> 05:59.270
May you hold each other's hands,

87
05:59.270 --> 06:00.630
grow old together,

88
06:00.870 --> 06:02.430
and be united forever.

89
06:03.390 --> 06:04.240
Well said!

90
06:04.240 --> 06:04.800
Great!

91
06:04.920 --> 06:05.600
Great!

92
06:10.040 --> 06:12.310
Next, let's welcome

93
06:13.360 --> 06:15.120
the groom's mother.

94
06:15.240 --> 06:16.120
Coming!

95
06:16.360 --> 06:17.360
Come on, Auntie Duan!

96
06:17.360 --> 06:18.430
Coming!

97
06:28.240 --> 06:30.270
Hello, everyone. I'm Duan,

98
06:30.430 --> 06:32.150
Jia Xin's mother.

99
06:32.870 --> 06:36.270
Thank you all for coming!

100
06:36.270 --> 06:37.310
Thank you!

101
06:39.680 --> 06:40.430
Many of my old colleagues

102
06:40.430 --> 06:41.920
are here today.

103
06:42.000 --> 06:43.600
I haven't seen you in years.

104
06:43.750 --> 06:45.920
I'll definitely have a good chat

105
06:45.920 --> 06:47.000
with you all later.

106
06:48.270 --> 06:51.310
I want to take this opportunity

107
06:51.390 --> 06:53.240
to thank my son, Jia Xin.

108
06:53.830 --> 06:55.830
Since he was a kid,

109
06:55.830 --> 06:58.800
he's been very honest.

110
06:59.390 --> 07:01.360
For so many years,

111
07:01.560 --> 07:04.040
I've been single-mindedly trying

112
07:04.040 --> 07:05.390
to get an explanation.

113
07:06.480 --> 07:07.600
He just followed me around

114
07:07.600 --> 07:09.190
every day,

115
07:09.360 --> 07:11.070
running here and there.

116
07:11.360 --> 07:12.240
Actually, many people

117
07:12.240 --> 07:14.510
looked down on us.

118
07:15.560 --> 07:16.360
He

119
07:17.390 --> 07:19.240
never complained once,

120
07:19.240 --> 07:20.480
not a single word.

121
07:20.870 --> 07:23.200
He just went along with whatever I wanted.

122
07:24.160 --> 07:25.430
Actually, I know

123
07:25.750 --> 07:28.600
he wanted me to move on.

124
07:28.800 --> 07:30.920
But I just couldn't let it go.

125
07:31.510 --> 07:34.000
I always felt that in life,

126
07:34.830 --> 07:36.230
no matter what happened,

127
07:36.920 --> 07:38.430
there must be justice.

128
07:40.159 --> 07:41.040
But I didn't expect

129
07:41.040 --> 07:43.120
that the justice I chased for 20 years

130
07:43.510 --> 07:44.360
would finally

131
07:44.830 --> 07:47.800
be found in my son.

132
07:50.070 --> 07:51.510
I've figured it out.

133
07:52.270 --> 07:55.070
People have to keep up with the times.

134
07:55.720 --> 07:57.270
No matter how you live,

135
07:57.310 --> 07:59.870
you have to move forward and look ahead.

136
08:00.310 --> 08:02.310
Just like my kidney stone,

137
08:02.920 --> 08:04.950
it can't stay stuck there forever.

138
08:05.310 --> 08:07.360
Either it comes out on its own,

139
08:07.360 --> 08:09.750
or you find someone to get it out.

140
08:10.830 --> 08:13.430
No matter where it was stuck before,

141
08:13.630 --> 08:16.630
as long as it can come out, it's not too late!

142
08:17.120 --> 08:19.270
-Right! -Right!

143
08:20.360 --> 08:23.600
Now, my son has found

144
08:24.360 --> 08:25.680
someone he can spend

145
08:26.000 --> 08:28.000
the rest of his life with, Xue.

146
08:28.720 --> 08:31.240
He has his own family now.

147
08:32.000 --> 08:34.120
I'm so content.

148
08:34.720 --> 08:36.549
My life has been

149
08:37.240 --> 08:38.030
worth it!

150
08:38.630 --> 08:39.120
Great!

151
08:39.150 --> 08:39.720
Great!

152
08:41.960 --> 08:42.789
Good son!

153
08:53.030 --> 08:53.840
My son,

154
08:54.440 --> 08:56.240
you'll always be my pride.

155
08:59.030 --> 09:00.030
Take a rest, Mom.

156
09:14.440 --> 09:15.270
Today

157
09:15.270 --> 09:17.240
is our big day.

158
09:19.630 --> 09:20.870
It's also a good day.

159
09:21.440 --> 09:22.910
I also want to share

160
09:23.320 --> 09:25.380
some of my true feelings with you all.

161
09:28.440 --> 09:29.390
Mom.

162
09:31.600 --> 09:32.430
I love you.

163
09:41.270 --> 09:42.270
Actually, in my mom's heart,

164
09:42.270 --> 09:44.480
I've always been outstanding.

165
09:46.670 --> 09:48.270
She thinks I'm pretty great.

166
09:49.870 --> 09:51.200
Actually, I'm not, Mom.

167
09:53.030 --> 09:54.830
During the time I was in trouble,

168
09:56.440 --> 09:59.300
I thought about just throwing in the towel for good.

169
09:59.840 --> 10:00.630
Really.

170
10:02.840 --> 10:04.570
Actually, one person appeared

171
10:06.200 --> 10:07.120
and saved me.

172
10:08.440 --> 10:10.480
He pulled me back

173
10:10.670 --> 10:12.120
and gave me a second life.

174
10:15.270 --> 10:16.800
His name is Liu Zhengliang.

175
10:17.030 --> 10:18.240
He is a doctor.

176
10:18.550 --> 10:20.390
I really want to thank him.

177
10:27.080 --> 10:28.120
And then what?

178
10:28.600 --> 10:29.730
I was failing again.

179
10:30.630 --> 10:31.750
I was scared again.

180
10:33.030 --> 10:34.150
I was scared

181
10:35.120 --> 10:36.030
I couldn't fit into

182
10:36.030 --> 10:36.870
this world.

183
10:39.200 --> 10:40.600
Another person appeared

184
10:40.960 --> 10:42.270
and saved me again.

185
10:45.960 --> 10:47.630
He sold his house

186
10:48.030 --> 10:49.560
to start a business with me.

187
10:51.120 --> 10:52.550
He is my best friend,

188
10:54.150 --> 10:55.200
my brother.

189
10:57.030 --> 10:58.560
His name is Liu Zhengguang.

190
10:58.750 --> 10:59.680
He's right here.

191
11:00.910 --> 11:02.310
Sitting in the front row.

192
11:03.910 --> 11:05.370
You're in the center seat.

193
11:09.630 --> 11:10.510
It's your turn.

194
11:12.440 --> 11:13.770
I don't know what to say.

195
11:17.840 --> 11:18.600
Finally,

196
11:19.910 --> 11:20.720
I want to thank

197
11:20.720 --> 11:22.000
the person next to me.

198
11:23.790 --> 11:24.320
Xue.

199
11:28.360 --> 11:30.630
Speaking of which, well,

200
11:31.320 --> 11:32.840
isn't my wife beautiful today?

201
11:32.840 --> 11:34.300
-Beautiful! -Beautiful!

202
11:34.840 --> 11:36.150
She's so beautiful!

203
11:36.150 --> 11:38.480
My wife is the most beautiful in the world!

204
11:38.960 --> 11:41.020
I fell for her the first time I saw her.

205
11:42.440 --> 11:43.480
As for me,

206
11:44.480 --> 11:45.940
I don't have much ability.

207
11:46.550 --> 11:49.030
I talk too much

208
11:49.270 --> 11:50.870
and speak without thinking.

209
11:52.440 --> 11:53.900
She has never despised me.

210
11:55.720 --> 11:56.980
When I was at my lowest,

211
11:57.480 --> 11:58.550
most desperate

212
12:00.320 --> 12:01.600
and most miserable,

213
12:03.440 --> 12:05.170
she was the one who pulled me up.

214
12:07.360 --> 12:08.240
I love you too.

215
12:10.240 --> 12:11.080
I love you too.

216
12:18.510 --> 12:19.510
Say a few words.

217
12:19.630 --> 12:20.670
I won't.

218
12:24.630 --> 12:25.870
Okay, I will.

219
12:26.360 --> 12:29.120
Actually, fate is quite wonderful.

220
12:31.790 --> 12:33.790
Sometimes it catches you off guard.

221
12:38.120 --> 12:39.850
One second everything is fine,

222
12:41.000 --> 12:43.000
and suddenly, an accident happens.

223
12:44.030 --> 12:45.120
You never know

224
12:45.120 --> 12:47.780
which will come first, tomorrow or an accident.

225
13:40.710 --> 13:42.570
[Ambulance] [120]

226
13:42.570 --> 13:43.940
[Fucheng Emergency Medical Rescue Center]

227
13:55.310 --> 13:56.940
[To the Surgical Inpatient Unit, go down one floor]

228
13:56.940 --> 13:58.580
[Accessible Route—Please Keep Clear]

229
13:59.140 --> 14:00.590
[Accessible Route—Please Keep Clear]

230
14:03.120 --> 14:04.290
[Operating Department]

231
14:04.320 --> 14:05.200
Mom, Mom, Mom!

232
14:05.910 --> 14:06.600
Save my mom!

233
14:06.600 --> 14:07.320
Mom!

234
14:07.840 --> 14:08.670
Save my mom!

235
14:10.970 --> 14:13.160
[Keep quiet]

236
14:36.510 --> 14:38.120
Three, two, one, go!

237
15:21.480 --> 15:22.480
We tried our best,

238
15:23.600 --> 15:25.000
but we couldn't save her.

239
15:27.510 --> 15:29.630
Mom!

240
15:53.120 --> 15:54.000
Amy.

241
16:42.870 --> 16:44.470
I used your treatment method

242
16:44.790 --> 16:45.840
to take a rubber band

243
16:45.840 --> 16:47.300
and snap myself all night.

244
17:11.510 --> 17:12.829
Go back to sleep.

245
17:14.920 --> 17:16.550
It's fine. No need.

246
17:22.720 --> 17:24.579
Don't you have surgery tomorrow?

247
17:27.000 --> 17:29.600
I work in the funeral business. I can handle it.

248
17:37.160 --> 17:38.880
It just hurts a little.

249
17:41.350 --> 17:42.680
It's all an experience.

250
17:52.240 --> 17:53.030
Okay.

251
17:54.480 --> 17:56.340
I'll come back tomorrow morning.

252
18:15.300 --> 18:19.330
[24-Hour One-Stop Funeral Services]

253
19:04.010 --> 19:08.470
[24-Hour One-Stop Funeral Services]

254
19:17.570 --> 19:24.640
[1314 Funeral Supplies] [Xiaoximen Store]

255
19:40.400 --> 19:41.400
See you tomorrow.

256
20:18.990 --> 20:26.950
[1314 Funeral Supplies] [Xiaoximen Store]

257
20:27.960 --> 20:29.420
Why haven't you gone back?

258
20:31.830 --> 20:33.160
It's nice here.

259
20:33.440 --> 20:34.700
I can keep you company.

260
20:46.160 --> 20:47.690
I want to go to the hospital.

261
20:48.750 --> 20:50.750
Why do you want to go to the hospital?

262
20:50.750 --> 20:52.010
To keep my mom company.

263
21:03.440 --> 21:05.240
If the funeral home wasn't full,

264
21:06.510 --> 21:07.240
I wouldn't have left her

265
21:07.240 --> 21:08.510
there all alone.

266
21:12.030 --> 21:13.630
I want to go and stay with her.

267
21:14.750 --> 21:16.830
Okay. I'll go with you.

268
21:24.750 --> 21:32.290
[Uphold Medical Ethics, Build a Model Hospital]

269
21:30.000 --> 21:30.880
Wait for me.

270
21:32.440 --> 21:35.910
[Emergency Item Storage]

271
21:34.160 --> 21:34.830
Li.

272
21:34.830 --> 21:36.030
Chief Physician Liu.

273
21:36.160 --> 21:37.510
I need to go downstairs.

274
21:37.510 --> 21:39.510
Can you unlock the stairwell for me?

275
21:40.110 --> 21:41.110
According to the rules,

276
21:41.110 --> 21:41.680
at this time,

277
21:41.680 --> 21:42.960
you are not allowed to go down,

278
21:42.960 --> 21:43.550
unless—

279
21:43.550 --> 21:44.640
I know. I know.

280
21:44.960 --> 21:46.400
We won't go into the morgue.

281
21:46.400 --> 21:48.200
We'll just sit at the door for a while.

282
21:48.200 --> 21:49.000
It's so late at night.

283
21:49.000 --> 21:49.960
Even if you don't go in,

284
21:49.960 --> 21:50.750
that place is—

285
21:50.750 --> 21:53.000
Can you just do me a favor?

286
21:56.160 --> 21:56.960
Okay.

287
21:56.830 --> 22:04.720
[Security Duty Room]

288
21:57.790 --> 21:58.480
Thank you.

289
21:58.480 --> 21:59.280
It's nothing.

290
22:10.440 --> 22:12.160
I still can't believe

291
22:12.160 --> 22:13.000
this is real.

292
22:16.030 --> 22:17.000
Once you go in

293
22:20.240 --> 22:21.200
this door,

294
22:21.200 --> 22:22.750
you can never come out.

295
22:29.350 --> 22:30.270
Say something.

296
22:32.510 --> 22:33.240
I thought you

297
22:33.240 --> 22:34.750
wanted me to stay quiet.

298
22:35.880 --> 22:36.640
I don't.

299
22:36.640 --> 22:37.770
Just say something.

300
22:39.070 --> 22:40.470
What do you want me to say?

301
22:44.440 --> 22:45.750
Just say anything.

302
22:47.830 --> 22:49.960
Help me distract myself.

303
23:02.240 --> 23:03.640
Let me tell you a secret.

304
23:06.400 --> 23:07.960
The truth is, I studied medicine

305
23:07.960 --> 23:09.560
because I'm afraid of dying.

306
23:12.400 --> 23:13.600
Doctors live longer?

307
23:14.440 --> 23:15.400
I don't think so.

308
23:15.880 --> 23:17.750
This job is way too demanding, after all.

309
23:17.750 --> 23:20.210
I'd be grateful if it didn't shorten my life.

310
23:21.550 --> 23:23.920
So it's to overcome the fear.

311
23:25.640 --> 23:27.100
Probably not that either.

312
23:27.960 --> 23:29.270
I used to think I could,

313
23:30.310 --> 23:31.170
but I couldn't.

314
23:33.550 --> 23:35.550
But later, after my mom passed away,

315
23:35.920 --> 23:37.320
I wasn't afraid anymore.

316
23:39.310 --> 23:40.590
They say parents

317
23:41.350 --> 23:42.440
are the last wall

318
23:42.440 --> 23:43.590
facing death.

319
23:46.680 --> 23:47.790
When that wall collapses,

320
23:47.790 --> 23:49.450
shouldn't you be more afraid?

321
23:50.310 --> 23:52.110
I didn't think about it at first.

322
23:53.000 --> 23:54.680
Later, after we got together,

323
23:55.350 --> 23:57.200
that feeling came back.

324
23:58.200 --> 24:00.260
I seem to understand a little bit now.

325
24:02.160 --> 24:03.160
I was afraid...

326
24:04.750 --> 24:06.110
I was afraid that others would be sad

327
24:06.110 --> 24:08.170
and heartbroken because of my death.

328
24:09.480 --> 24:11.010
So after my mom passed away,

329
24:11.880 --> 24:13.280
I wasn't afraid anymore.

330
24:13.830 --> 24:14.880
So,

331
24:15.790 --> 24:16.750
now that I'm here,

332
24:16.750 --> 24:18.080
you're afraid instead?

333
24:21.400 --> 24:22.240
So,

334
24:22.510 --> 24:24.790
that's why I didn't want to get close to others

335
24:24.790 --> 24:26.990
or want people to care too much about me.

336
24:33.750 --> 24:35.070
Why are you so weird?

337
24:38.200 --> 24:40.600
I'm afraid others will be sad because of me.

338
24:40.680 --> 24:42.880
Because I've experienced this feeling

339
24:43.310 --> 24:45.720
for many years since I was a child.

340
24:47.480 --> 24:49.080
What's there to be afraid of?

341
24:50.310 --> 24:51.640
I'm very strong.

342
24:53.030 --> 24:54.310
Absolutely.

343
24:56.110 --> 24:57.160
People who are afraid of death,

344
24:57.160 --> 24:58.310
before they die,

345
24:58.510 --> 24:59.680
will experience countless times

346
24:59.680 --> 25:00.750
the fear of death.

347
25:01.310 --> 25:02.310
But truly brave people,

348
25:02.310 --> 25:03.370
in their lifetime,

349
25:03.640 --> 25:04.680
only die once.

350
25:13.310 --> 25:15.070
Have you ever thought about one day

351
25:15.070 --> 25:16.350
how you will die one day?

352
25:16.350 --> 25:17.160
I have.

353
25:19.400 --> 25:20.830
But I hope it

354
25:21.440 --> 25:22.840
is a death with a warning.

355
25:24.270 --> 25:25.070
That way, I can

356
25:25.070 --> 25:26.240
calmly face

357
25:26.440 --> 25:27.640
the arrival of death.

358
25:29.440 --> 25:30.680
I hope so too.

359
25:35.720 --> 25:36.510
My mom

360
25:36.510 --> 25:38.270
just left too suddenly.

361
25:41.310 --> 25:42.270
Actually,

362
25:43.590 --> 25:45.200
growing up, I got used to

363
25:45.200 --> 25:46.830
her leaving me suddenly.

364
25:49.960 --> 25:51.270
But this time...

365
26:00.200 --> 26:02.070
I seem to have no hope left.

366
26:24.310 --> 26:26.770
You feel the same way about Aunt Ling, right?

367
26:28.240 --> 26:29.300
Not quite the same.

368
26:30.110 --> 26:31.070
After all, my mom

369
26:31.160 --> 26:32.920
found out about her illness first.

370
26:32.920 --> 26:34.440
But she didn't tell you?

371
26:36.960 --> 26:38.360
She did it for my own good.

372
26:39.070 --> 26:41.160
You see, even when she left,

373
26:41.160 --> 26:42.760
she was still thinking of me.

374
26:43.270 --> 26:47.310
If I get sick one day,

375
26:48.110 --> 26:49.640
I will definitely tell you.

376
26:50.830 --> 26:52.030
What are you looking at?

377
26:52.030 --> 26:53.350
You have to cure me.

378
26:53.960 --> 26:55.070
Absolutely.

379
26:55.310 --> 26:57.110
I must, okay?

380
26:57.350 --> 26:58.200
Absolutely.

381
27:10.920 --> 27:12.120
Do you hear any noise?

382
27:15.070 --> 27:16.200
Let's go take a look.

383
27:24.350 --> 27:25.240
Amy.

384
27:28.880 --> 27:30.210
What are you doing here?

385
27:33.310 --> 27:34.510
I was afraid your mom would be cold.

386
27:34.510 --> 27:35.830
So I brought her a coat.

387
27:40.440 --> 27:41.200
Dad.

388
27:45.510 --> 27:46.570
Alright, alright.

389
27:47.350 --> 27:48.110
Dad.

390
27:48.550 --> 27:49.160
I'm here.

391
27:50.000 --> 27:50.750
I'm here.

392
27:54.530 --> 27:57.680
♪ A soul that came to earth amid the cries ♪

393
27:58.130 --> 28:01.230
♪ Welcome to this city of haste ♪

394
28:01.740 --> 28:04.030
♪ Grow taller, quick as you can ♪

395
28:03.870 --> 28:11.740
[Fucheng Funeral Services]

396
28:04.400 --> 28:06.710
♪ Learn how to find your footing ♪

397
28:08.870 --> 28:12.200
♪ A soul who hid among the lanes and alleys ♪

398
28:12.700 --> 28:15.900
♪ A single turn, and the lamp at the door grows distant ♪

399
28:16.300 --> 28:18.690
♪ The ticket bears no way back ♪

400
28:18.980 --> 28:21.370
♪ How like life it is ♪

401
28:23.650 --> 28:26.870
♪ One who nestled close on a winter's night ♪

402
28:27.290 --> 28:30.440
♪ A bite of food beside a pool of gaze ♪

403
28:30.930 --> 28:33.080
♪ When summer dusk arrives ♪

404
28:33.530 --> 28:35.790
♪ We'll go to see the flowers ♪

405
28:38.220 --> 28:41.340
♪ One who was stranded on the road ♪

406
28:41.840 --> 28:45.010
♪ Heels buried under unseen snow ♪

407
28:45.360 --> 28:47.650
♪ Don't panic—the journey is long ♪

408
28:48.110 --> 28:50.530
♪ Long enough to hold your pause ♪

409
28:52.650 --> 28:55.150
♪ May every road you take be safe ♪

410
28:55.340 --> 28:59.450
♪ May the scenery stay simple and carry you past regret ♪

411
28:59.960 --> 29:03.070
♪ Love deeply whatever comes to meet you ♪

412
29:03.580 --> 29:06.850
♪ And let those who leave be buried under snow on the hills ♪

413
29:07.270 --> 29:09.840
♪ May you come home covered in dust ♪

414
29:10.020 --> 29:14.000
♪ Held by what you love as you roam the world and return ♪

415
29:15.350 --> 29:19.800
♪ Saying the flowers by the door are truly beautiful ♪

416
29:55.530 --> 29:57.810
♪ The wind in the city ♪

417
29:58.250 --> 30:00.990
♪ Blows through dreams that flicker between light and dark ♪

418
30:01.870 --> 30:04.610
♪ Blows through one soul's radiance ♪

419
30:04.070 --> 30:06.480
It must be beautiful.

420
30:06.200 --> 30:08.620
♪ And all its weathered scars ♪

421
30:07.350 --> 30:10.960
That's why you never came back.

422
30:10.180 --> 30:12.380
♪ Blows through the depths of winter ♪

423
30:12.200 --> 30:17.880
Is there anyone accompanying you along the scenic journey?

424
30:12.690 --> 30:15.590
♪ Stumbling along in the wind ♪

425
30:16.650 --> 30:19.220
♪ Flickering along in the wind ♪

426
30:20.910 --> 30:26.760
♪ Toward the crossroads brimming with sunlight ♪

427
30:31.190 --> 30:34.260
♪ You'll pass through the seasons, through dawn and dusk ♪

428
30:34.770 --> 30:37.870
♪ Hearing someone call your name, again and again ♪

429
30:38.340 --> 30:40.600
♪ It hurts to say goodbye ♪

430
30:41.120 --> 30:43.320
♪ If you can't recover, just wait ♪

431
30:45.590 --> 30:48.860
♪ It will bear witness to the life you bravely lived ♪

432
30:49.120 --> 30:52.500
♪ To the beautiful souls you've loved ♪

433
30:52.910 --> 30:55.080
♪ To the address you call home ♪

434
30:55.490 --> 31:00.500
♪ We come to each other ♪

435
31:36.890 --> 31:41.640
[Our service includes what others don't do. Our duty covers what everyone does.]

436
32:34.240 --> 32:35.680
You two, sit down.

437
32:57.160 --> 32:57.960
Dad.

438
32:59.590 --> 33:00.640
Don't be too sad.

439
33:01.790 --> 33:03.250
Your health is important.

440
33:04.550 --> 33:06.070
Well, there are a few things

441
33:06.070 --> 33:07.730
I want to talk to you two about.

442
33:07.790 --> 33:09.550
About our current...

443
33:10.750 --> 33:11.550
two shops,

444
33:12.240 --> 33:13.920
Ai Chen is over there,

445
33:14.920 --> 33:16.230
and Xiaozhu is here.

446
33:17.030 --> 33:18.790
I was thinking about the staffing.

447
33:18.790 --> 33:21.880
Should we hire two more people?

448
33:23.750 --> 33:25.280
Xiaozhu, what do you think?

449
33:25.880 --> 33:27.140
I'll listen to my Chen.

450
33:32.030 --> 33:34.070
We can decide on hiring later.

451
33:35.400 --> 33:37.330
Do you have something on your mind?

452
33:38.000 --> 33:39.550
No, I don't.

453
33:40.240 --> 33:42.310
I don't have anything on my mind.

454
33:42.880 --> 33:43.680
Well...

455
33:44.590 --> 33:45.400
Xiaozhu.

456
33:46.110 --> 33:48.350
It's time for you to date.

457
33:49.830 --> 33:51.360
Why are we talking about me?

458
33:53.110 --> 33:53.920
I...

459
33:56.240 --> 33:58.240
I started dating someone recently.

460
34:00.440 --> 34:02.900
The staff at the internet cafe I always go to.

461
34:03.070 --> 34:05.070
Her family is from around here.

462
34:05.240 --> 34:06.570
We know each other well.

463
34:07.960 --> 34:08.760
That's good.

464
34:08.880 --> 34:09.670
That's good.

465
34:10.550 --> 34:13.070
Take it seriously.

466
34:13.840 --> 34:15.510
Date to settle down.

467
34:16.510 --> 34:17.510
Be responsible.

468
34:18.960 --> 34:21.159
I will definitely be responsible, Dad.

469
34:22.480 --> 34:23.190
Later,

470
34:24.230 --> 34:25.630
when we burn paper money,

471
34:27.070 --> 34:28.070
tell her about it.

472
34:29.400 --> 34:30.230
Let your mom

473
34:31.630 --> 34:32.469
know.

474
34:33.920 --> 34:34.710
Later,

475
34:35.880 --> 34:37.340
when your mom is over there

476
34:37.630 --> 34:38.960
and sees your dad,

477
34:39.510 --> 34:40.190
well,

478
34:41.800 --> 34:43.460
she'll have something to say.

479
34:48.400 --> 34:49.190
Ai Chen.

480
34:51.070 --> 34:51.880
Well...

481
34:53.030 --> 34:53.630
No matter

482
34:53.630 --> 34:55.710
how far you and Zhengliang

483
34:55.800 --> 34:57.320
go in the future,

484
34:58.510 --> 35:00.280
you must

485
35:01.400 --> 35:02.670
have your own ideas.

486
35:03.670 --> 35:05.470
You must have your own opinions.

487
35:06.960 --> 35:08.510
Don't just listen to him.

488
35:10.360 --> 35:11.320
If there's something—

489
35:11.320 --> 35:12.630
Wait, I know...

490
35:14.590 --> 35:15.440
I know all this.

491
35:15.440 --> 35:17.070
But why are you telling me this?

492
35:17.070 --> 35:17.710
What do you mean?

493
35:17.710 --> 35:19.640
Do you have something on your mind?

494
35:23.550 --> 35:24.710
Your mom...

495
35:28.840 --> 35:30.070
Before going to sleep,

496
35:30.070 --> 35:30.920
well...

497
35:31.920 --> 35:33.110
she always told me.

498
35:33.510 --> 35:35.840
She said you have a strong personality,

499
35:36.440 --> 35:38.440
and she was afraid you'd wrong Zhengliang.

500
35:38.440 --> 35:40.840
She was also afraid you'd love him too much,

501
35:41.280 --> 35:42.550
and you'd suffer.

502
35:48.150 --> 35:48.710
I...

503
35:49.920 --> 35:51.250
I'll only say that once.

504
35:52.590 --> 35:53.510
Remember?

505
35:54.400 --> 35:55.150
Yeah.

506
35:55.230 --> 35:56.000
Good.

507
35:57.960 --> 35:58.760
Good.

508
36:05.800 --> 36:07.320
Anything else?

509
36:08.030 --> 36:09.550
Nothing else.

510
36:11.840 --> 36:12.230
Oh right,

511
36:12.230 --> 36:15.150
I... I want to take a break for a while.

512
36:16.440 --> 36:17.280
Well...

513
36:19.280 --> 36:21.360
Find something else to do.

514
36:22.000 --> 36:23.260
I haven't decided yet.

515
36:23.920 --> 36:25.920
I just don't want to do this anymore.

516
36:26.400 --> 36:27.190
I...

517
36:30.670 --> 36:31.530
I was thinking,

518
36:32.400 --> 36:34.320
doing this makeup for your mom

519
36:35.670 --> 36:36.930
would be the last time.

520
36:40.440 --> 36:41.240
I understand.

521
36:47.150 --> 36:48.280
Don't worry

522
36:49.510 --> 36:50.840
about work anymore.

523
36:52.920 --> 36:54.840
You need to feel at ease,

524
36:55.840 --> 36:56.670
okay?

525
37:04.320 --> 37:05.280
Well,

526
37:05.280 --> 37:07.670
you two go ahead and get busy.

527
37:09.110 --> 37:09.960
Let me

528
37:11.190 --> 37:12.550
sit here by myself

529
37:14.190 --> 37:15.070
for a while.

530
37:58.670 --> 37:59.440
Sun,

531
38:01.590 --> 38:02.920
my wife has passed away.

532
38:05.710 --> 38:06.360
She...

533
38:08.030 --> 38:08.760
She...

534
38:09.840 --> 38:13.230
If you run into her over there,

535
38:15.230 --> 38:16.890
please take care of her for me.

536
38:23.400 --> 38:24.360
Thank you.

537
38:26.020 --> 38:29.840
[Xinguang Script Roleplay Club]

538
38:31.960 --> 38:33.090
I'll get going then.

539
38:37.710 --> 38:38.480
Zhengguang.

540
38:39.800 --> 38:41.000
Let's chat a bit more.

541
38:44.030 --> 38:45.840
I feel bad going back now anyway.

542
38:49.000 --> 38:49.800
About what?

543
38:52.630 --> 38:53.830
About your business.

544
38:57.400 --> 38:58.920
The building was empty for 2 years,

545
38:58.920 --> 39:00.080
so the rent is dirt cheap.

546
39:00.080 --> 39:05.240
[Xinguang Script Roleplay Club]

547
39:00.320 --> 39:01.480
We wrote the stories ourselves,

548
39:01.480 --> 39:02.880
and for props,

549
39:02.880 --> 39:04.320
we either bought second-hand

550
39:04.320 --> 39:05.650
or made them ourselves.

551
39:06.190 --> 39:07.630
We hired students part-time.

552
39:07.630 --> 39:08.590
If we control the costs well,

553
39:08.590 --> 39:09.590
it should be fine.

554
39:11.710 --> 39:13.840
You're making money off young people.

555
39:14.000 --> 39:15.440
Fucheng is so big,

556
39:16.150 --> 39:19.210
but the number of young people is decreasing every day.

557
39:19.230 --> 39:20.030
Will it work?

558
39:22.840 --> 39:24.590
I've actually thought about that.

559
39:24.590 --> 39:25.510
I was thinking,

560
39:25.510 --> 39:27.240
once the shop is up and running,

561
39:27.550 --> 39:29.510
we can add things like murder mystery games

562
39:29.510 --> 39:31.230
and video games.

563
39:31.440 --> 39:32.150
Isn't that what young people

564
39:32.150 --> 39:33.150
love to play?

565
39:36.760 --> 39:38.290
Zhengguang, you're loyal.

566
39:39.360 --> 39:41.020
I know you want to help Jia Xin,

567
39:42.320 --> 39:43.030
but if you two lose money,

568
39:43.030 --> 39:44.560
won't you lose it together?

569
39:44.800 --> 39:46.760
You have no risk resistance at all.

570
39:47.510 --> 39:49.150
If you put all your eggs in one basket

571
39:49.150 --> 39:49.960
and slip,

572
39:49.960 --> 39:51.160
won't they all break?

573
39:54.190 --> 39:54.710
Alright.

574
39:54.710 --> 39:56.310
Junnan, I know what you mean.

575
39:56.880 --> 39:57.670
You just want to persuade me

576
39:57.670 --> 39:58.630
to work with you.

577
40:00.150 --> 40:01.400
My company

578
40:01.630 --> 40:03.090
is registered in Beijing.

579
40:03.110 --> 40:04.770
I've got a small office there,

580
40:05.190 --> 40:07.550
but the factory is still in Dayushu.

581
40:08.000 --> 40:08.800
Remember,

582
40:10.150 --> 40:11.920
this is our home turf.

583
40:13.480 --> 40:14.920
Whenever you want to come back,

584
40:14.920 --> 40:16.520
come back and visit anytime.

585
40:20.920 --> 40:22.580
Let me think about it, Junnan.

586
40:22.840 --> 40:23.550
Okay.

587
40:25.320 --> 40:26.050
I'm leaving.

588
40:28.360 --> 40:32.160
[Xinguang Script Roleplay Club]

589
40:33.670 --> 40:34.600
Thanks, Junnan.

590
40:45.710 --> 40:46.920
Morning, Chief Physician Liu.

591
40:46.920 --> 40:47.450
Morning.

592
40:58.480 --> 40:59.280
You scared me.

593
40:59.760 --> 41:00.690
Why are you here?

594
41:01.920 --> 41:03.110
I'm not sure about something,

595
41:03.110 --> 41:04.840
so I wanted to ask your opinion.

596
41:05.590 --> 41:07.450
Why does everyone ask my opinion?

597
41:08.190 --> 41:09.190
Besides examining brains,

598
41:09.190 --> 41:10.150
I don't know anything else.

599
41:10.150 --> 41:11.190
I have no opinion.

600
41:11.880 --> 41:12.590
Two heads

601
41:12.590 --> 41:13.840
are better than one.

602
41:13.840 --> 41:17.100
I'm not asking you to take responsibility for your advice.

603
41:17.150 --> 41:18.400
Okay, tell me.

604
41:18.920 --> 41:19.710
What is it?

605
41:21.230 --> 41:23.280
Do you think my business will succeed?

606
41:23.280 --> 41:25.030
I really don't know anything about business.

607
41:25.030 --> 41:26.560
I can't give you any advice.

608
41:27.280 --> 41:28.880
Just tell me your intuition.

609
41:33.230 --> 41:33.960
It's hard to say.

610
41:33.960 --> 41:36.280
So it's a 50% chance of making money

611
41:36.320 --> 41:37.590
and a 50% chance of losing money,

612
41:37.590 --> 41:38.280
right?

613
41:43.480 --> 41:44.280
Zhengguang,

614
41:44.760 --> 41:46.420
you're only in your twenties.

615
41:46.920 --> 41:48.650
You don't need to overthink it.

616
41:49.320 --> 41:51.850
You should try more things when you're young.

617
41:52.110 --> 41:53.400
The experience

618
41:53.550 --> 41:54.760
is what matters most.

619
41:57.320 --> 41:59.650
I don't have the capital to make mistakes.

620
42:00.070 --> 42:01.280
I don't have any savings either,

621
42:01.280 --> 42:03.140
but I'm doing just fine, aren't I?

622
42:03.190 --> 42:04.250
That's different.

623
42:04.670 --> 42:05.800
You have professional skills,

624
42:05.800 --> 42:07.110
and you're very good at them.

625
42:07.110 --> 42:08.190
Even if you only had a pair of underwear left,

626
42:08.190 --> 42:09.390
you wouldn't starve.

627
42:09.960 --> 42:11.280
Stop agonizing over it.

628
42:11.280 --> 42:12.880
You've invested all your money.

629
42:12.880 --> 42:14.010
Do you have a choice?

630
42:18.190 --> 42:19.030
Junnan said

631
42:19.190 --> 42:20.590
he wanted me to give the escape room to Jia Xin

632
42:20.590 --> 42:21.590
and work with him.

633
42:23.280 --> 42:24.030
That's fine.

634
42:24.030 --> 42:25.230
It's another option.

635
42:26.000 --> 42:27.000
But the key is,

636
42:27.000 --> 42:28.930
you need to know what he wants to do.

637
42:30.190 --> 42:31.280
He seemed to say

638
42:31.320 --> 42:33.110
he wants to open the company in Beijing.

639
42:33.110 --> 42:34.760
He can't put down roots in Beijing, can he?

640
42:34.760 --> 42:35.890
Isn't that perfect?

641
42:36.880 --> 42:37.840
Haven't you repeatedly said

642
42:37.840 --> 42:40.240
you want to develop your career in Beijing?

643
42:43.000 --> 42:44.660
I haven't thought it through.

644
42:44.920 --> 42:45.960
Well, Beijing

645
42:46.510 --> 42:47.370
is pretty good.

646
42:47.800 --> 42:49.320
My hometown is also pretty good.

647
42:49.320 --> 42:50.800
But Beijing has its problems,

648
42:50.800 --> 42:52.860
and my hometown has its problems too.

649
42:53.800 --> 42:55.150
I'm talking a lot of nonsense.

650
42:55.150 --> 42:56.410
Do you know what I mean?

651
42:56.440 --> 42:57.230
I do.

652
42:58.670 --> 42:59.480
No, you don't.

653
42:59.920 --> 43:00.960
Stop humoring me.

654
43:00.960 --> 43:01.670
You said it yourself.

655
43:01.670 --> 43:03.030
You don't know anything except treating patients.

656
43:03.030 --> 43:04.630
I really do understand this.

657
43:06.800 --> 43:08.800
I'll take you somewhere after work.

658
43:10.030 --> 43:10.840
Where?

659
43:11.190 --> 43:12.480
You'll know when we get there.
